        {
            "id": "urn:summary_document_transcript:quartr.com:3987890:0",
            "title": "RLJ: Q2 delivered 6.8% RevPAR growth and 7% EBITDA growth, driving raised full-year guidance",
            "description": "<div class=\"body-bgeA9NCs body-pP5gm7BF content-pP5gm7BF\"><div class=\"symbolsContainer-rV5QygYP logosContainer-WbDJg_kR\" data-no-swipe=\"true\"></div><div><span><p class=\"\"><span>Second quarter results exceeded expectations, with 6.8% RevPAR growth, 7% hotel EBITDA growth, and strong performance in urban markets. Raised full-year guidance reflects continued momentum in business travel, leisure, and group segments, supported by successful renovations and conversions.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>Based on </span></p><section class=\"variant-secondary-Gmpzg_mv disclaimer-vMD6Mpww\"><b class=\"heading-wrapper-Gmpzg_mv\"><span class=\"heading-Gmpzg_mv\">Disclaimer</span></b><div class=\"content-Gmpzg_mv link-with-underline-Gmpzg_mv\"><span>This is an AI-generated summary and may contain inaccuracies. Please verify any important information with the original source.</span></div></section></span></div></div>",
